  m_Name: BeforeTutor1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - "Asahi: You\u2019ve been staring at that vending machine for a while. You thirsty,
    or just looking for someone to talk to? "
  - " \u2026\u2026\u2026.. "
  - Hey. I thought the one running the ops should at least know how to talk.
  - " \u2026.."
  - "Hel\u2014 "
  - "You\u2019re distracting me. I can\u2019t decide between vanilla or whipped cream
    flavor."
  - " Huh. I thought team communication was supposed to be important. Guess sugar
    comes first for you. Maybe try looking at the person you\u2019re talking to?
    Heeey\u2014"
  - " \u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026\u2026"
  - "Alright, fine. If it were me, I\u2019d go with whipped cream. Sounds unique."
  - "First\u2014 yeah, thanks. Second\u2014 I\u2019m not \u201Chey\u201D or \u201Chello\u201D.
    Third\u2014 I prefer sour over sweet. Nice to meet you. \u2026Or is that part
    of the list too? Never mind. Bye. Go... do something useful."
  - "Well\u2026.That was a good start, right?"
